LPTA is for the printer connected to the Z19 graphics board
LPTB is for the Teletype connected to the PDP8/A in the MS Lab
LPTC is for a printer connected to the parallel port of the 8/a
LPTD is for a printer connected to VAX device port
LPTI is for the TI printer (XON/XOFF, 40/41)
.R FUTIL

FILE LPTA    gives (block #)
        B
        C
(block #).0/<CR>
WR 24
